<title>MALTA: Malta to issue $9.18 million Treasury bills.</title>
<headline>Malta to issue $9.18 million Treasury bills.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury on Friday will issue Lm3.4 million ($9.18 million) in 91-day treasury bills maturing on May 2, 1997.</p>
<p>The yield rate is 5.0052 percent per annum, unchanged from the previous 91-day issue of January 24.</p>
</text>
